兼容性问题；\r\n2、负责FTL算法实现（IO性能、映射管理、垃圾回收、磨损均衡等）的开发与优化；\r\n3、负责NAND Flash驱动支持、量产流程开发及固件问题的定位与分析。","Require":"1、2027 届应届毕业生，硕士研究生优先考虑，优秀本科生亦可投递 ；\n2、通过 CET-4，CET6及以上优先考虑；\n3、有良好的沟通表达能力、责任感、目标感\n4、精通C语言，熟悉嵌入式系统开发，熟练使用RTOS，有存储产品开发相关经验者优先","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-11T18:08:31","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"7e5d0828-1061-4b8d-a335-d05b3a8bb125","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561283821,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"‌客户项目经理/CPM(台湾工作)(J11436)","OrgId":2166558,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、負責全球（非中國大陸區）大客戶嵌入式產品項目支持；\n2、負責客戶項目Design-in和Design-Win及售後全生命週期管理，全面管控客戶項目進度、範圍、質量、資源、風險、相關方等，輸出客戶項目報告並提出改進建議；\n3、作為客戶項目交付的第一責任人，組建項目支持團隊，對客戶項目順利導入和量產公司產品負責；\n4、引導公司各方資源保證產品按時導入、項目按時量產；\n5、總結客戶項目管理策略、客戶相關方全息圖、客戶需求特點，洞察客戶商機線索，為客戶經營提供支撐信息；\n6、組織客戶技術交流，熟悉公司產品和關鍵指標，能夠承擔部分產品推廣任務；\n7、作為客戶與公司間的核心紐帶，與客戶建立長期信任關係，及時響應客戶需求並處理投訴，提升客戶滿意度。","Require":"1、本科及以上學歷，電子信息、通信工程、計算機科學等應用技術學科專業優先；\n2、3年以上電子/通信相關行業經驗，有存儲行業/SoC行業工作經驗優先；憧憬半導體行業相關崗位；\n3、具備強執行力、目標感和責任心，具備逆向思維和優秀的團隊協作能力；\n4、掌握Flash，Memory基本常識，對存儲產品有系統性認識；\n5、英語口語流利，有PMP/ACP/NPDP等證書者優先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-10T20:36:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"7608aaf1-0e89-4243-8634-b59fc597c4a8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561282584,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级软件工程师(J11358)","OrgId":2103192,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责NAND晶圆CP探针测试方案制定、评估与落地，依据产品Spec、JEDEC标准完成DC/AC电性、逻辑功能、时序、功耗等全项测试覆盖。\n2. 基于量产测试机台，进行CP测试程序开发、调试、优化、版本管控与release，完成测试向量、时序、电压电流参数配置与验证。\n3. 负责新产品NPI阶段CP测试导入，完成测试环境搭建、探针台、探针卡、ATE硬件联调、测试验证与量产转阶。\n4. 日常量产良率数据统计、分析与追踪，监控良率趋势、失效分布及参数波动，主导良率改善专案，定位设计、工艺、测试端根因并推动闭环改善。\n5. 负责失效品电性筛选、初步失效分析，输出分析报告，协同FA、工艺、设计团队深入拆解问题，提供测试端改善建议。\n6. 协同制程、设计、品控、后端FT测试等跨部门团队，同步项目进度，解决上下游测试衔接问题，支撑产品量产与品质管控。\n7. 持续优化测试流程、测试时间与测试成本，导入自动化分析脚本与工具，提升测试效率与产能。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，微电子、电子信息、集成电路、自动化等相关专业。\n2. 熟悉NAND存储器基本架构、工作原理及常用电气参数，有半导体晶圆CP测试经验优先。\n3. 熟悉ATE测试设备、探针台、探针卡基本原理与日常维护，具备测试程序调试及问题排查能力。\n4. 了解数字/模拟电路基础，熟悉常用测试原理、时序概念、电性量测方法。\n5. 具备基础数据分析能力，熟练使用Excel/JMP/数据分析工具，有Python脚本能力加分。\n6. 具备良好的问题分析与解决能力，抗压性强，能配合产线处理突发异常。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-06T15:57:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"1c1bb5b5-a64c-4fa6-92f1-5bb47a3accc0","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561270819,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"实习-软件类(J11245)","OrgId":2102887,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"3","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"AI存储工程师、嵌入式软件开发工程师、闪存工程师、算法工程师、软件流程管理工程师岗位\n负责软件研发类相关工作","Require":"1. 大二/大三或者研一-研三的在校学生；\n2.可以实习6-12个月；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":fals